  NEOGATE_SKIP_INSTALL=1    Same as --skip-install
  NEOGATE_SKIP_RELAY_TEST=1 Same as --skip-relay-test
  CODEX_HOME                 Codex config directory. Default: ~/.codex
  CLAUDE_HOME                Claude Code config directory. Default: ~/.claude
